This repository extracts and re-packages the Omarchy screensaver for NixOS.

- Launch scripts, ASCII transcoder, and terminal configs are adapted from
  basecamp/omarchy (https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy).
- Runtime effects are provided by ttfx (https://github.com/omacom-io/ttfx),
  a port of TerminalTextEffects by ChrisBuilds
  (https://github.com/ChrisBuilds/terminaltexteffects).

Neither Basecamp nor the ttfx authors endorse this packaging.
